 its intended audience.", "ACEITE DE OLIVA:Aceite de Oliva, or olive oil, is a versatile cooking oil widely used in various recipes, including those designed for dysphagia management. It is recognized for its health benefits, particularly its high content of oleic acid, a monounsaturated fatty acid associated with cardiovascular health. This oil is a staple in Mediterranean diets and is commonly used for frying, dressing dishes, and enhancing flavors in recipes such as Crema Fría de Melón con Jamón, Salmorejo, and Magdalena de espinacas.\n\nIn Spain, Aceite de Oliva can be classified under Denominación de Origen Protegida (DOP), with over 30 designated regions producing this high-quality oil. It serves as a source of healthy fats and is recommended for balancing omega-3 and omega-6 fatty acids in dietary mixes. Additionally, olive oil is noted for its role in parenteral nutrition and is suggested for use in low-sodium cooking.\n\nOverall, Aceite de Oliva is not only a flavorful ingredient but also a key component of a healthy diet, contributing to lower blood pressure levels and promoting overall well-being, making it suitable for all age groups, including children.", "MEDALLONES DE MERLUZA EN SALSA VERDE:MEDALLONES DE MERLUZA EN SALSA VERDE is a dish that features hake medallions served in a flavorful green sauce. This dish is specifically designed for individuals with dysphagia, making it suitable for patients who experience swallowing difficulties. The preparation includes a detailed recipe that outlines the necessary ingredients and cooking methods to create this accessible and nutritious meal.", "RALLADURA DE HUEVO CON TOMATE:RALLADURA DE HUEVO CON TOMATE is a dish that combines grated egg with tomato, specifically designed for individuals with dysphagia, ensuring it is easy to swallow. The preparation involves using eggs and tomato sauce, complemented by steamed potatoes, which are boiled and mashed to create a smooth texture. This dish caters to dietary needs while providing a flavorful and nutritious option.", "LASAÑA DE CALABACÍN Y RABO DE TORO:A dish made with zucchini and oxtail, tailored for individuals with dysphagia.", "DELICIAS DE ATÚN CON TOMATE:\"DELICIAS DE ATÚN CON TOMATE\" is a dish that features tuna loin, onion, leek, and tomato sauce, which is formed into various shapes and cooked in a rich tomato sauce. This dish is not only flavorful but also suitable for individuals with dysphagia, making it accessible for those who require softer food options.", "SUFLÉ DE SALMÓN EN SALSA DE NARANJA:\"SUFLÉ DE SALMÓN EN SALSA DE NARANJA\" is a culinary dish that features a soufflé made from salmon, accompanied by a flavorful orange sauce. This dish is specifically designed for individuals with dysphagia, ensuring that it is both palatable and easy to consume for those who may have difficulty swallowing.", "MILHOJAS DE CALABAZA Y EMPERADOR:MILHOJAS DE CALABAZA Y EMPERADOR is a culinary dish that consists of layers of pumpkin and emperor fish. It is specifically designed for individuals with swallowing difficulties, including those with dysphagia. This dish caters to the dietary needs of those who may struggle with traditional food textures, ensuring a safe and enjoyable eating experience.", "NATILLAS DE HUEVO CASERAS:NATILLAS DE HUEVO CASERAS is a traditional homemade egg custard dessert that is made with egg yolks, milk, and sweeteners. This dessert is particularly suitable for individuals with dysphagia, making it a popular choice in hospital kitchens. Its creamy texture and rich flavor make it a comforting option for those who may have difficulty swallowing, while also retaining its status as a beloved classic in various culinary traditions.", "CREMA DE QUESO CON PURÉ DE MEMBRILLO:Crema de queso con puré de membrillo is a dessert that combines cheese cream and quince puree, specifically designed for individuals with dysphagia. This dish is prepared using fresh cheese, membrillo, and milk, which are mixed together and then refrigerated to achieve the desired consistency. The combination of these ingredients creates a creamy and flavorful treat that caters to those who may have difficulty swallowing, while also offering a delightful taste experience.", "MELOCOTÓN CON QUESO:Melocotón con queso is a dish that features peaches served with cheese, specifically designed for individuals with dysphagia, a condition that makes swallowing difficult. This dish is made from peaches in syrup paired with fresh cheese, and it is commonly prepared for patients in hospital settings, ensuring that it meets the dietary needs of those who may have difficulty consuming regular foods.", "MANZANA ASADA RELLENA DE CREMA DE LIMÓN:The \"MANZANA ASADA RELLENA DE CREMA DE LIMÓN\" is a dessert that features a baked apple filled with a creamy lemon filling. This dish is prepared using specific ingredients and culinary techniques, making it a delightful treat. It is also suitable for individuals with dysphagia, ensuring that it can be enjoyed by those who may have difficulty swallowing. Overall, the \"MANZANA ASADA RELLENA DE CREMA DE LIMÓN\" combines the comforting texture of baked apple with the refreshing taste of lemon cream, making it a versatile and appealing dessert option.", "SEMIFRÍO DE PIÑA:The SEMIFRÍO DE PIÑA is a semi-frozen dessert specifically crafted for individuals with dysphagia, a condition that affects swallowing. This dessert is made using pineapple, yogurt, and gelatin, ensuring it is both palatable and suitable for those with specific dietary needs. The combination of these ingredients creates a refreshing and smooth texture, making it an ideal choice for patients requiring modified food textures.", "PUDIN DE MELOCOTÓN Y QUESO:PUDIN DE MELOCOTÓN Y QUESO is a dessert recipe that combines the flavors of peach and cheese to create a unique pudding. The recipe includes detailed instructions on the ingredients and the cooking process, making it accessible for those looking to prepare this dish. Additionally, this pudding is specifically tailored for individuals with dysphagia, ensuring that it is suitable for those who may have difficulty swallowing. Overall, PUDIN DE MELOCOTÓN Y QUESO is a delightful and accommodating dessert option that highlights the harmonious blend of peach and cheese."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}